<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;">The votes required to elect the director nominees and to approve the other proposals being considered at the Annual Meeting are summarized below, along with the effect of broker non-votes and abstentions, and voting options for each proposal.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="2" cellspacing="0" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt;">

