			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 9pt; text-align: justify;">Based on information set forth in Schedule 13G/A filed on February 13, 2026. Manulife Financial Corporation may be deemed beneficial owner of shares held by its subsidiaries Manulife Investment Management (US) LLC, a registered investment adviser, and Manulife Investment Management Limited.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

		<tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top;">
			<td style="width: 36pt;">
			<p style="text-align: justify; font-size: 9pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; margin: 0pt;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(9)</sup></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 9pt; text-align: justify;">As of December 31, 2025, the ESOP held 143,942 shares of common stock that have not been allocated to Plan participants. As of December 31, 2025, the Plan maintains 267,988 shares that have been allocated to Plan participants. A total of 411,930 shares are held in the Plan.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">To our knowledge, except as noted above, no person or entity is the beneficial owner of more than 5% of the voting power of the Company&#8217;s stock.</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">&#160;</p>

<hr style="text-align: center; height: 1px; color: #000000; background-color: #000000; width: 25%; border: none; margin: 3pt auto"/>
<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

